														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4243709">
									

<p>Really liked it. Definitely a sneakier SCP, takes a few re-reads to grasp the bigger picture, and all the little details.</p>
<p>My only suggestion (just suggestions!) would be for the test log:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Testing has been delayed indefinitely due to ethical qualms.&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>is a bit out of place. &quot;Delayed&quot; seems a bit ambiguous. &quot;Ethical Qualms&quot; doesn't feel very Foundation. It feels like there's a need to justify the absence to the reader, or that there's an uncertainty in the decision.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Testing has been suspended indefinitely by order of the Ethics Committee.&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Seems a bit more appropriate. &quot;Canceled&quot; or &quot;Forbidden&quot; might also apply, if you want to emphasize that testing was planned, but never executed. The &quot;Ethics Committee&quot; rather than &quot;ethical qualms&quot; removes uncertainty, as though those with an authority are saying testing with this SCP is unethical.</p>
<p>+1 Overall!</p>

